      "messageId": "message-2",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm an AI assistant with a specialization in **STEM education, visualization, and animation development**. I combine tutoring capabilities with hands-on creative tools to help you learn, explore, and demonstrate concepts interactively.\n\n## What I Can Do\n\n### 🎓 **Teaching & Tutoring**\n- Explain complex STEM topics (math, physics, engineering, computer science) step-by-step\n- Walk through problem sets and derivations\n- Answer questions about algorithms, equations, and scientific concepts\n\n### 🎬 **Animation & Visualization**\nI have specialized tools to create interactive and animated content:\n\n- **Three.js** — 3D scenes and simulations (e.g., pendulums, orbital mechanics, 3D geometry)\n- **p5.js** — 2D/3D generative art and interactive sketches (e.g., wave interference, fractals, particle systems)\n- **Manim** — Cinematic math animations for precise educational videos (e.g., calculus derivations, linear algebra transformations)\n\n### 🌐 **Research & Fact-Checking**\n- Search the web for current information, papers, and documentation\n- Browse specific websites to extract detailed content\n- Verify facts and find up-to-date data\n\n### 💻 **Development Environment**\nI have a full sandbox workspace where I can:\n- Write and edit code files (Python, JavaScript, HTML, etc.)\n- Install packages and run scripts\n- Build and test applications\n\n### 🛠️ **How to Work With Me**\nJust tell me what you need! For example:\n- *\"Create a 3D simulation of a double pendulum\"*\n- *\"Explain quantum superposition with an animation\"*\n- *\"Search for the latest research on CRISPR applications\"*\n- *\"Build an interactive p5.js sketch showing Fourier transforms\"*\n\nWhat would you like to explore or create today?",
